    {
      "source": "Set the given pagination information on the <a href=\"Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> instance. Will transparently set <code>offset</code> and\n<code>limit</code> as well as applying the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> instance defined with the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在<a href=\"Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a>实例上设置给定的分页信息。该方法将透明地设置<code>offset</code>和<code>limit</code>，并应用由<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>定义的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Query object representing <a href=\"Criteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Criteria</code></a>, columns, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>, and limit/offset for a SQL query. Methods on this\nclass are designed to be used in a fluent style creating immutable objects.",
      "translation": "表示 SQL 查询的 Criteria、列、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>以及限制/偏移量的 Query 对象。<a href=\"Criteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.query\"><code>Criteria</code></a>。此类的旨在以流式风格创建不可变对象的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
